    <section class="introduction">
      <p class="wide">Some releases need a quick migration check because an API or default changed. Choose your target version below, and follow the older guides in order if your application is several major versions behind.</p>
    </section>

    <h2 id="version-10">Migrating to 10.0.0</h2>
    <section>
      <div class="view">
        <p>Version 10.0.0 is a major overhaul: it closes long-standing gaps, substantially expands the library, and reworks much of the API.
          Use the migration guide to update safely, with OpenRewrite recipes to help automate part of the upgrade.</p>
        <a class="button" href="migration-notes-10.0.0.html#navigation">Review the 10.0.0 changes</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 id="version-9-2">Migrating to 9.2</h2>
    <section>
      <div class="view">
		<p>Version 9.2 changes governance-builder call order, asynchronous failure reporting, serialized email snapshots, configuration precedence, and several security defaults.</p>
		<a class="button" href="migration-notes-9.2.0.html#navigation">Review the 9.2 changes</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 id="version-9">Migrating to 9.0</h2>
    <section>
      <div class="view">
        <p>Version 9 consolidates the dedicated recipient-builder API and changes several existing behaviors. Start here when moving from 8.x.</p>
        <a class="button" href="migration-notes-9.0.0.html#navigation">Open the 9.0 migration guide</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 id="version-8">Migrating to 8.0</h2>
    <section>
      <div class="view">
        <p>Version 8 moved defaults and overrides out of the email builder and into Mailer governance.</p>
        <a class="button" href="migration-notes-8.0.0.html#navigation">Open the 8.0 migration guide</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 id="historical-migrations">Historical major migrations</h2>
    <section>
      <div class="button-group">
        <a class="button" href="migration-notes-7.0.0.html#navigation">Migrating to 7.0</a>
        <a class="button" href="migration-notes-6.0.0.html#navigation">Migrating to 6.0</a>
        <a class="button" href="migration-notes-5.0.0.html#navigation">Migrating to 5.0</a>
      </div>
      <p class="wide">If your application predates version 5, follow each major-version guide in order instead of jumping straight to the newest examples.</p>
    </section>

    <h2 id="release-history">Release history</h2>
    <section>
